<!--
  One page and one document. The site is deliberately a single URL, so this
  file exists to declare the résumé as much as the page — a PDF is crawled and
  its text indexed, but only if something points a crawler at it.

  <changefreq> and <priority> are omitted on purpose: Google has ignored both
  for years, and a field nobody reads is a field that goes stale unwatched.

  Update <lastmod> when the page or the résumé changes. It is the one claim in
  here that can be wrong.
-->
